# ludic.steam - the Steamworks runtime API as a mechanic: start-up and its state machine, the user and
# friends, rich presence, lobbies, achievements and stats driven by data registries, leaderboards,
# cloud files, Steam Input, DLC, the timeline, and a ludic.net socket over Steam's relay. Uses
# ludic.base and nothing else; the SDK itself is ludic.steamworks (or the fake, for tests).
# See README.md.
package "ludic.steam"
version "0.1.0"
kind source
